+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a new `CSVDocumentSplitter` component that divides CSV documents into
+    sub-tables. Consecutive empty rows or columns that exceed the configured
+    thresholds are used as delimiters, so a CSV file holding several tables is
+    split into one Document per table.
